IndexTTS-2.5 Low-VRAM Patch
===========================

This repository contains patches and launchers only. It contains no model
weights and no third-party runtime.

Upstream model and code
-----------------------
IndexTTS-2.5 is created and owned by bilibili (index-tts project).
    https://github.com/index-tts/index-tts
The original license is included as LICENSE (English) and LICENSE_ZH.txt
(Chinese, "bilibili 模型使用许可协议"). All rights to the model, its weights and
the original code remain with bilibili.

What this repository adds
-------------------------
* indextts/vram.py            - capability-based dtype selection and stage swapping
* apply.py                    - installer that patches an existing installation
* launchers/webui_6g.bat      - launcher with low-VRAM defaults
* tools/vram_bench.py         - per-GPU fp32/fp16/bf16 measurement
* tools/e2e_probe.py          - reproduction script for the README numbers

